Title: ONE FLAG ON EVEREST
Author: Art City AI Studio
Draft date: 2026-08-22
Contact: Production Hub · AC Script
Format: Fountain
Runtime: ~1 minute

====

FADE IN:

EXT. EVEREST SUMMIT RIDGE - DAWN

Wind tears white snow sideways. A MAN (40s), frost on his beard, crawls the last meters on his knees. Rope frayed. Gloves torn. Each breath a fight.

He plants an ice axe. Almost falls. Stays.

He pulls a folded cloth from his jacket — the Kurdistan flag. His hands shake so hard he almost drops it.

MAN
(whisper)
For those who could not climb…

He forces the flag onto the axe. The wind tries to rip it away. He holds it with both arms, body against the storm, until the cloth catches and rises — bright against the white peak.

A long beat. He looks toward the horizon. Tears freeze on his face. He smiles once.

The flag snaps in the wind above Everest.

FADE OUT.

